---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — GetFOSS"
  description="Get in touch with GetFOSS to suggest open-source software, report an issue, or share feedback."
  canonicalPath="/contact/"
>
  <main class="content-shell">
    <article class="prose">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p>
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p class="lede">Have a suggestion, found an issue, or want to share something with the FOSS community? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
      </header>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>For general questions, feedback, corrections, and suggestions, email us:</p>
      <p><strong><a href="mailto:info@getfoss.org">info@getfoss.org</a></strong></p>

      <h2>Suggest a FOSS project</h2>
      <p>Know a great free and open-source application that deserves more attention? Send us its name, website, source code repository, and a short explanation of why you recommend it.</p>

      <h2>Report an issue</h2>
      <p>If you notice incorrect information, a broken link, or a technical problem on the website, please let us know. Include the page URL and a description of the issue so we can investigate.</p>

      <h2>Contribute</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS supports the open-source community. You can explore the project and contribute through our <a href="https://github.com/Avdro/getfoss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repository</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
